WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.969
- I AM HERE
WITH OZAMATAZ BUCKSHANK,

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:03.437
THE ROOKIE
OUT OF STANFORD UNIVERSITY

00:00:03.437 --> 00:00:07.040
WHO IS UNDOUBTEDLY THE MVP
OF TODAY'S GAME

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.076
WITH AN INTERCEPTION THAT
HE RUNS BACK FOR A TOUCHDOWN

00:00:09.076 --> 00:00:11.545
IN THE LAST 30 SECONDS
OF THE CONTEST.

00:00:11.545 --> 00:00:14.114
OZAMATAZ, CAN YOU WALK US
THROUGH WHAT HAPPENED

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.249
IN THAT LAST PLAY?

00:00:15.249 --> 00:00:16.650
IT WAS AMAZING.
- YEAH, WE KNEW WE HAD TO GO

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.052
OUT THERE, GIVE 100%,
AND WE EXECUTED.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.287
IT JUST WENT OUR WAY TODAY.

00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:21.755
- AND WAS THE QUARTERBACK
GIVING YOU

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.857
ANY CLUES TODAY, OZ?

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:24.925
IT LOOKED LIKE YOU KNEW
THAT BALL WAS GONNA BE THERE.

00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:26.393
WHAT WAS HAPPENING?

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:29.329
- WE WANTED TO HAVE SOME FUN,
YOU KNOW, EXECUTE.

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.765
PLAY ONE QUARTER AT A TIME,
GIVE 100%.

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:33.767
- OH--OKAY, OKAY.
YOU KNOW, LET'S JUST--

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.068
LET'S TALK
ABOUT LAST WEEK'S GAME.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:37.638
YOU GUYS LOST A HEARTBREAKER.

00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:40.340
GIVE ME YOUR STATE OF MIND,
THEN VERSUS NOW.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.075
- WE WANTED
TO DO IT PLAY BY PLAY,

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:44.311
GIVE IT 100%,
EXECUTION-WISE.

00:00:44.311 --> 00:00:46.380
EXECUTE.
- OKAY.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.881
I'M GONNA ASK YOU SOMETHING
COMPLETELY DIFFERENT

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:48.882
THAT'S NOT ABOUT FOOTBALL.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.883
LOOK AT ME, OZ.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.084
JUST LOOK AT ME FOR A SECOND.

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.119
I'M GONNA ASK YOU A QUESTION
RIGHT HERE.

00:00:52.119 --> 00:00:53.553
THAT A BOY.
SO YOU AND YOUR WIFE

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:54.821
RECENTLY HAD--
RIGHT HERE.

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:56.023
STAY WITH ME.

00:00:56.023 --> 00:00:58.091
YOU AND YOUR WIFE
RECENTLY HAD TWINS, OKAY?

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.893
HOW DOES IT FEEL
TO BE A NEW DAD?

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.362
- YOU KNOW, WE WANTED TO STAY
AS A TEAM, EXECUTE,

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:04.665
GIVE 100%,
PLAY BY PLAY.

00:01:04.665 --> 00:01:07.000
- OKAY, YOU KNOW WHAT,
I'M GONNA JUST--I'M JUST GONNA--

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.902
I'M GONNA DO A LITTLE TEST
RIGHT NOW.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.305
HEY, OZ, HOW'D YOU GET
TO THE GAME TODAY?

00:01:11.305 --> 00:01:15.809
- THEY A GOOD TEAM,
GREAT TEAM, 100%.

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.611
- AND WHAT'D YOU HAVE
FOR DINNER LAST NIGHT?

00:01:17.611 --> 00:01:18.812
- 100%.
- 100%. YEAH, YOU DID.

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:21.648
OF COURSE.
100% OF WHATEVER 100% WAS.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.917
YOU KNOW WHAT,
CAN YOU JUST DO ME A FAVOR

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.619
AND TELL ME
ONE SPECIFIC THING?

00:01:25.619 --> 00:01:29.923
LIKE, JUST ONE ACTUAL, ORIGINAL
OBSERVATION THAT YOU HAD

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.992
ABOUT TODAY'S GAME?

00:01:31.992 --> 00:01:35.329
THE GAME THAT YOU WON
ALMOST SINGLE-HANDEDLY.

00:01:35.329 --> 00:01:36.830
DO YOU THINK
THAT YOU COULD DO THAT, OZ?

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.132
- OH, 100%.
- OH, GOD DAMN IT!

